Objective: Hunt for encoded or anomalous PowerShell command-line activity associated with post-exploitation and payload download.
KQL Query: 
SecurityEvent
| where TimeGenerated > ago(7d)
| where EventID == 4688 // New Process Created
| where Process has "powershell.exe"
| where CommandLine has_any ("-enc", "-encodedcommand", "downloadstring", "iex")
| project TimeGenerated, Computer, Account, CommandLine
Analysis & Triage: Mapped execution behaviors to MITRE ATT&CK Technique T1059.001 (Command and Scripting Interpreter: PowerShell).
